{"seq":4,"slug":"plugin-distribution","title":"插件打包与分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/jetbrains-plugin/plugin-distribution","wordCount":1132,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"插件打包与分发\">插件打包与分发</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>JetBrains 插件的打包与分发涉及从源代码构建到最终用户安装的完整流程。JetBrains Marketplace 是官方的插件分发平台，为所有 JetBrains IDE（IntelliJ IDEA、WebStorm、PyCharm 等）提供统一的插件生态系统。</p>\n<p>与 VS Code 的 <code>vsce</code> 打包工具不同，IntelliJ 插件使用 Gradle 构建系统完成打包，输出格式为包含 <code>lib/</code> 目录的 ZIP 文件。插件的兼容性管理也更为复杂，需要声明支持的 IDE 产品和版本范围。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[源代码] --&gt; B[Gradle 构建]&#10;    B --&gt; C[编译 + 资源处理]&#10;    C --&gt; D[plugin.xml 验证]&#10;    D --&gt; E[JAR 打包]&#10;    E --&gt; F[ZIP 分发包]&#10;    F --&gt; G{分发渠道}&#10;    G --&gt; H[JetBrains Marketplace]&#10;    G --&gt; I[企业内部仓库]&#10;    G --&gt; J[手动安装]&#10;    H --&gt; K[审核流程]&#10;    K --&gt; L[公开发布]\">graph TD\n    A[源代码] --&gt; B[Gradle 构建]\n    B --&gt; C[编译 + 资源处理]\n    C --&gt; D[plugin.xml 验证]\n    D --&gt; E[JAR 打包]\n    E --&gt; F[ZIP 分发包]\n    F --&gt; G{分发渠道}\n    G --&gt; H[JetBrains Marketplace]\n    G --&gt; I[企业内部仓库]\n    G --&gt; J[手动安装]\n    H --&gt; K[审核流程]\n    K --&gt; L[公开发布]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>JetBrains Marketplace</th>\n<th align=\"right\">VS Code Marketplace</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>打包格式</td>\n<td>ZIP (含 lib/)</td>\n<td align=\"right\">VSIX (ZIP 变体)</td>\n<td>底层都是 ZIP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建工具</td>\n<td>Gradle</td>\n<td align=\"right\">vsce CLI</td>\n<td>生态差异大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审核机制</td>\n<td>人工 + 自动</td>\n<td align=\"right\">自动为主</td>\n<td>JetBrains 审核更严格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>付费支持</td>\n<td>Freemium + 许可证</td>\n<td align=\"right\">免费为主</td>\n<td>JetBrains 有完善的付费体系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本兼容</td>\n<td>sinceBuild/untilBuild</td>\n<td align=\"right\">engines.vscode</td>\n<td>IntelliJ 的版本号更复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更新频率</td>\n<td>按 IDE 大版本</td>\n<td align=\"right\">随时更新</td>\n<td>JetBrains IDE 每年 3 个大版本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"插件打包与版本管理\">插件打包与版本管理</h2><p>IntelliJ 插件的打包通过 Gradle 完成。IntelliJ Platform Gradle Plugin 2.x 提供了完整的构建生命周期管理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// build.gradle.kts&#10;plugins {&#10;    id(&quot;org.jetbrains.intellij.platform&quot;) version &quot;2.0.0&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;intellijPlatform {&#10;    pluginConfiguration {&#10;        id = &quot;com.example.awesome-plugin&quot;&#10;        name = &quot;Awesome Plugin&quot;&#10;        version = &quot;2.1.0&quot;&#10;&#10;        description = &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;            &lt;h2&gt;Awesome Plugin for IntelliJ&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;            &lt;p&gt;This plugin provides amazing code analysis features.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;            &lt;ul&gt;&#10;                &lt;li&gt;Smart code inspection&lt;/li&gt;&#10;                &lt;li&gt;One-click refactoring&lt;/li&gt;&#10;                &lt;li&gt;Performance profiling integration&lt;/li&gt;&#10;            &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;.trimIndent()&#10;&#10;        changeNotes = &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;            &lt;h3&gt;2.1.0&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;            &lt;ul&gt;&#10;                &lt;li&gt;Added support for Kotlin 2.0&lt;/li&gt;&#10;                &lt;li&gt;Fixed false positive in empty catch inspection&lt;/li&gt;&#10;                &lt;li&gt;Improved performance for large projects&lt;/li&gt;&#10;            &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;.trimIndent()&#10;&#10;        ideaVersion {&#10;            sinceBuild = &quot;241&quot;&#10;            untilBuild = &quot;242.*&quot;&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        vendor {&#10;            name = &quot;Example Inc.&quot;&#10;            email = &quot;plugins@example.com&quot;&#10;            url = &quot;https://example.com/plugins&quot;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    publishing {&#10;        token = providers.environmentVariable(&quot;JETBRAINS_MARKETPLACE_TOKEN&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pluginVerification {&#10;        ides {&#10;            recommended()&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// build.gradle.kts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>plugins {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    id(\"org.jetbrains.intellij.platform\") version \"2.0.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>intellijPlatform {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pluginConfiguration {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        id = \"com.example.awesome-plugin\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        name = \"Awesome Plugin\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        version = \"2.1.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        description = \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;h2>Awesome Plugin for IntelliJ&#x3C;/h2></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;p>This plugin provides amazing code analysis features.&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                &#x3C;li>Smart code inspection&#x3C;/li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                &#x3C;li>One-click refactoring&#x3C;/li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                &#x3C;li>Performance profiling integration&#x3C;/li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;/ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"\"\".trimIndent()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        changeNotes = \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;h3>2.1.0&#x3C;/h3></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                &#x3C;li>Added support for Kotlin 2.0&#x3C;/li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                &#x3C;li>Fixed false positive in empty catch inspection&#x3C;/li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                &#x3C;li>Improved performance for large projects&#x3C;/li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;/ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"\"\".trimIndent()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ideaVersion {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            sinceBuild = \"241\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            untilBuild = \"242.*\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        vendor {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            name = \"Example Inc.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            email = \"plugins@example.com\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            url = \"https://example.com/plugins\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    publishing {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        token = providers.environmentVariable(\"JETBRAINS_MARKETPLACE_TOKEN\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pluginVerification {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ides {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            recommended()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>版本兼容性是 IntelliJ 插件发布中最容易出错的环节。JetBrains IDE 使用<strong>构建号</strong>（Build Number）标识版本：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>构建号格式</th>\n<th>IDE 版本</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>241.*</code></td>\n<td>2024.1.x</td>\n<td>IntelliJ IDEA 2024.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>242.*</code></td>\n<td>2024.2.x</td>\n<td>IntelliJ IDEA 2024.2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>243.*</code></td>\n<td>2024.3.x</td>\n<td>IntelliJ IDEA 2024.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>251.*</code></td>\n<td>2025.1.x</td>\n<td>IntelliJ IDEA 2025.1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>sinceBuild</code> 指定最低兼容版本，<code>untilBuild</code> 指定最高兼容版本。推荐策略是设置 <code>untilBuild</code> 为当前主版本的通配符（如 <code>242.*</code>），在每个新 IDE 版本发布后测试并更新。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"./gradlew buildPlugin&#10;# 输出: build/distributions/awesome-plugin-2.1.0.zip&#10;&#10;unzip -l build/distributions/awesome-plugin-2.1.0.zip&#10;# awesome-plugin/lib/awesome-plugin-2.1.0.jar&#10;# awesome-plugin/lib/instrumented-awesome-plugin-2.1.0.jar&#10;# awesome-plugin/lib/dependency-1.0.0.jar\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./gradlew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> buildPlugin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出: build/distributions/awesome-plugin-2.1.0.zip</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">unzip</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build/distributions/awesome-plugin-2.1.0.zip</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># awesome-plugin/lib/awesome-plugin-2.1.0.jar</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># awesome-plugin/lib/instrumented-awesome-plugin-2.1.0.jar</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># awesome-plugin/lib/dependency-1.0.0.jar</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"plugin-verifier-与兼容性检查\">Plugin Verifier 与兼容性检查</h2><p><code>verifyPlugin</code> 任务使用 IntelliJ Plugin Verifier 工具检查插件的 API 兼容性。它会扫描插件字节码中对 IntelliJ Platform API 的引用，找出已废弃、已移除或不兼容的 API 调用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"pluginVerification {&#10;    ides {&#10;        recommended()&#10;        ide(IntelliJPlatformType.IntellijIdeaCommunity, &quot;2024.1&quot;)&#10;        ide(IntelliJPlatformType.IntellijIdeaCommunity, &quot;2024.2&quot;)&#10;        ide(IntelliJPlatformType.IntellijIdeaCommunity, &quot;2024.3&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    failureLevel = listOf(&#10;        FailureLevel.COMPATIBILITY_PROBLEMS,&#10;        FailureLevel.MISSING_DEPENDENCIES&#10;    )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>pluginVerification {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ides {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        recommended()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ide(IntelliJPlatformType.IntellijIdeaCommunity, \"2024.1\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ide(IntelliJPlatformType.IntellijIdeaCommunity, \"2024.2\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ide(IntelliJPlatformType.IntellijIdeaCommunity, \"2024.3\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    failureLevel = listOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        FailureLevel.COMPATIBILITY_PROBLEMS,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        FailureLevel.MISSING_DEPENDENCIES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"./gradlew verifyPlugin\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./gradlew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> verifyPlugin</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Verifier 会报告以下类型的问题：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Plugin Verification Results:&#10;───────────────────────────&#10;Compatibility problems (3):&#10;  #1 Method com.intellij.openapi.editor.Editor.getProject()&#10;     → removed in 2024.2 (use FileEditorManager instead)&#10;  #2 Class com.intellij.util.ui.UIUtil.FontSize&#10;     → moved to com.intellij.ui.FontSize in 2024.1&#10;  #3 Method invocation on deprecated API&#10;     → PsiManager.findFile(VirtualFile) deprecated since 2023.3&#10;&#10;Missing dependencies (1):&#10;  #1 Plugin &#39;com.intellij.java&#39; is not bundled in WebStorm\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Plugin Verification Results:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>───────────────────────────</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Compatibility problems (3):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  #1 Method com.intellij.openapi.editor.Editor.getProject()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     → removed in 2024.2 (use FileEditorManager instead)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  #2 Class com.intellij.util.ui.UIUtil.FontSize</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     → moved to com.intellij.ui.FontSize in 2024.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  #3 Method invocation on deprecated API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     → PsiManager.findFile(VirtualFile) deprecated since 2023.3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Missing dependencies (1):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  #1 Plugin 'com.intellij.java' is not bundled in WebStorm</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[buildPlugin] --&gt; B[verifyPlugin]&#10;    B --&gt; C{兼容性检查}&#10;    C --&gt;|通过| D[准备发布]&#10;    C --&gt;|失败| E[查看报告]&#10;    E --&gt; F{问题类型}&#10;    F --&gt;|API 移除| G[更新到新 API]&#10;    F --&gt;|API 废弃| H[计划迁移]&#10;    F --&gt;|依赖缺失| I[调整 depends 声明]&#10;    G --&gt; A&#10;    H --&gt; D&#10;    I --&gt; A&#10;    D --&gt; J[publishPlugin]\">flowchart TD\n    A[buildPlugin] --&gt; B[verifyPlugin]\n    B --&gt; C{兼容性检查}\n    C --&gt;|通过| D[准备发布]\n    C --&gt;|失败| E[查看报告]\n    E --&gt; F{问题类型}\n    F --&gt;|API 移除| G[更新到新 API]\n    F --&gt;|API 废弃| H[计划迁移]\n    F --&gt;|依赖缺失| I[调整 depends 声明]\n    G --&gt; A\n    H --&gt; D\n    I --&gt; A\n    D --&gt; J[publishPlugin]</pre><p>处理 API 迁移的常见策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 使用反射兼容多版本&#10;fun getEditorProject(editor: Editor): Project? {&#10;    return try {&#10;        editor.project&#10;    } catch (e: NoSuchMethodError) {&#10;        FileEditorManager.getInstance(editor.project!!).selectedEditor?.file?.let {&#10;            ProjectLocator.getInstance().guessProjectForFile(it)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 使用 @Suppress 标记已知废弃&#10;@Suppress(&quot;DEPRECATION&quot;)&#10;fun legacyMethod() {&#10;    // 在迁移计划内的废弃 API 调用&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用反射兼容多版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun getEditorProject(editor: Editor): Project? {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        editor.project</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } catch (e: NoSuchMethodError) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        FileEditorManager.getInstance(editor.project!!).selectedEditor?.file?.let {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ProjectLocator.getInstance().guessProjectForFile(it)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用 @Suppress 标记已知废弃</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Suppress(\"DEPRECATION\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun legacyMethod() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 在迁移计划内的废弃 API 调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"marketplace-发布流程\">Marketplace 发布流程</h2><p>发布到 JetBrains Marketplace 需要完成以下步骤：创建开发者账号、获取 API Token、配置 Gradle 发布任务、提交审核。</p>\n<p>首先在 Marketplace 网站获取发布 Token：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 设置环境变量（CI/CD 中通常存储在 Secret 中）&#10;export JETBRAINS_MARKETPLACE_TOKEN=&quot;perm:xxxx-xxxx-xxxx&quot;&#10;&#10;# 通过 Gradle 发布&#10;./gradlew publishPlugin\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 设置环境变量（CI/CD 中通常存储在 Secret 中）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> JETBRAINS_MARKETPLACE_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"perm:xxxx-xxxx-xxxx\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 通过 Gradle 发布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./gradlew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> publishPlugin</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对于 CI/CD 自动发布，推荐使用 GitHub Actions：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: Publish Plugin&#10;&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    tags:&#10;      - &#39;v*&#39;&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  publish:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      - name: Setup JDK&#10;        uses: actions/setup-java@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          distribution: &#39;temurin&#39;&#10;          java-version: &#39;17&#39;&#10;&#10;      - name: Setup Gradle&#10;        uses: gradle/actions/setup-gradle@v3&#10;&#10;      - name: Build Plugin&#10;        run: ./gradlew buildPlugin&#10;&#10;      - name: Verify Plugin&#10;        run: ./gradlew verifyPlugin&#10;&#10;      - name: Run Tests&#10;        run: ./gradlew test&#10;&#10;      - name: Publish Plugin&#10;        run: ./gradlew publishPlugin&#10;        env:&#10;          JETBRAINS_MARKETPLACE_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.JETBRAINS_MARKETPLACE_TOKEN }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Publish Plugin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    tags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'v*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  publish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Setup JDK</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-java@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          distribution</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'temurin'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          java-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'17'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Setup Gradle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">gradle/actions/setup-gradle@v3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Build Plugin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./gradlew buildPlugin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Verify Plugin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./gradlew verifyPlugin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Run Tests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./gradlew test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Publish Plugin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./gradlew publishPlugin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          JETBRAINS_MARKETPLACE_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.JETBRAINS_MARKETPLACE_TOKEN }}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>发布后插件进入审核队列。JetBrains 审核团队会检查：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>审核项目</th>\n<th>检查内容</th>\n<th>常见拒绝原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>安全性</td>\n<td>恶意代码、数据泄露</td>\n<td>上报用户数据未声明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兼容性</td>\n<td>API 使用正确性</td>\n<td>使用内部 API（<code>@ApiStatus.Internal</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量</td>\n<td>功能完整性、崩溃率</td>\n<td>空指针异常、内存泄漏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>描述</td>\n<td>准确描述功能</td>\n<td>描述与功能不符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>许可证</td>\n<td>开源许可证合规</td>\n<td>使用 GPL 库但未声明</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"付费插件与许可证管理\">付费插件与许可证管理</h2><p>JetBrains Marketplace 支持 Freemium 模式的付费插件。插件可以提供免费试用期，之后需要购买许可证才能继续使用。许可证验证通过 JetBrains 的 License API 实现。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class MyLicenseChecker {&#10;    fun isLicensed(): Boolean {&#10;        val licenseStatus = LicensingFacade.getInstance()&#10;            ?.getConfirmationStamp(&quot;com.example.awesome-plugin&quot;)&#10;        return licenseStatus != null&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun getLicenseExpirationDate(): Date? {&#10;        return LicensingFacade.getInstance()&#10;            ?.getLicenseExpirationDate(&quot;com.example.awesome-plugin&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun showTrialExpiredDialog(project: Project) {&#10;        Messages.showWarningDialog(&#10;            project,&#10;            &quot;Your trial period has expired. Please purchase a license to continue using this plugin.&quot;,&#10;            &quot;License Required&quot;&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class MyLicenseChecker {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun isLicensed(): Boolean {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val licenseStatus = LicensingFacade.getInstance()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ?.getConfirmationStamp(\"com.example.awesome-plugin\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return licenseStatus != null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun getLicenseExpirationDate(): Date? {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return LicensingFacade.getInstance()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ?.getLicenseExpirationDate(\"com.example.awesome-plugin\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun showTrialExpiredDialog(project: Project) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Messages.showWarningDialog(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            project,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"Your trial period has expired. Please purchase a license to continue using this plugin.\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"License Required\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 <code>plugin.xml</code> 中声明付费信息：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;idea-plugin&gt;&#10;    &lt;product-descriptor code=&quot;AWESOMEPLUGIN&quot; release-date=&quot;20240101&quot; release-version=&quot;21&quot;/&gt;&#10;    &lt;!-- code: 产品代码，需在 Marketplace 注册 --&gt;&#10;    &lt;!-- release-date: 首次发布日期 (YYYYMMDD) --&gt;&#10;    &lt;!-- release-version: 主版本号 * 10 (2.1 → 21) --&gt;&#10;&lt;/idea-plugin&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">idea-plugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">product-descriptor</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AWESOMEPLUGIN\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> release-date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"20240101\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> release-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"21\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    &#x3C;!-- code: 产品代码，需在 Marketplace 注册 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    &#x3C;!-- release-date: 首次发布日期 (YYYYMMDD) --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    &#x3C;!-- release-version: 主版本号 * 10 (2.1 → 21) --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">idea-plugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>付费插件的定价策略在 Marketplace 后台配置，支持年度订阅、月度订阅和永久许可证三种模式。JetBrains 从销售额中收取 5% 的平台费用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant U as 用户&#10;    participant P as 插件&#10;    participant L as LicensingFacade&#10;    participant M as Marketplace API&#10;&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;P: 使用付费功能&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;L: getConfirmationStamp()&#10;    L-&gt;&gt;M: 验证许可证&#10;    M--&gt;&gt;L: 许可证状态&#10;    L--&gt;&gt;P: 有效/过期/试用&#10;    alt 许可证有效&#10;        P-&gt;&gt;U: 正常使用&#10;    else 试用期内&#10;        P-&gt;&gt;U: 显示试用提示&#10;    else 许可证过期&#10;        P-&gt;&gt;U: 显示购买对话框&#10;    end\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant U as 用户\n    participant P as 插件\n    participant L as LicensingFacade\n    participant M as Marketplace API\n\n    U-&gt;&gt;P: 使用付费功能\n    P-&gt;&gt;L: getConfirmationStamp()\n    L-&gt;&gt;M: 验证许可证\n    M--&gt;&gt;L: 许可证状态\n    L--&gt;&gt;P: 有效/过期/试用\n    alt 许可证有效\n        P-&gt;&gt;U: 正常使用\n    else 试用期内\n        P-&gt;&gt;U: 显示试用提示\n    else 许可证过期\n        P-&gt;&gt;U: 显示购买对话框\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"企业内部分发与自定义仓库\">企业内部分发与自定义仓库</h2><p>对于不适合公开发布的企业内部插件，IntelliJ 支持配置<strong>自定义插件仓库</strong>（Custom Plugin Repository）。企业可以搭建私有仓库服务，统一管理和分发内部插件。</p>\n<p>自定义仓库的最简实现是一个 HTTP 服务器，提供符合 IntelliJ 格式的 XML 插件列表：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot;?&gt;&#10;&lt;plugins&gt;&#10;    &lt;plugin&#10;        id=&quot;com.company.internal-tool&quot;&#10;        url=&quot;https://plugins.company.com/files/internal-tool-1.2.0.zip&quot;&#10;        version=&quot;1.2.0&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;idea-version since-build=&quot;241&quot; until-build=&quot;242.*&quot;/&gt;&#10;        &lt;name&gt;Internal Tool&lt;/name&gt;&#10;        &lt;description&gt;Company internal development tool&lt;/description&gt;&#10;        &lt;vendor&gt;Company Name&lt;/vendor&gt;&#10;    &lt;/plugin&gt;&#10;    &lt;plugin&#10;        id=&quot;com.company.code-standards&quot;&#10;        url=&quot;https://plugins.company.com/files/code-standards-3.0.1.zip&quot;&#10;        version=&quot;3.0.1&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;idea-version since-build=&quot;241&quot; until-build=&quot;243.*&quot;/&gt;&#10;        &lt;name&gt;Code Standards&lt;/name&gt;&#10;        &lt;description&gt;Company coding standards enforcement&lt;/description&gt;&#10;        &lt;vendor&gt;Company Name&lt;/vendor&gt;&#10;    &lt;/plugin&gt;&#10;&lt;/plugins&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-