an style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">vendor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>Company Name&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">vendor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">plugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">plugins</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>用户在 IDE 中添加自定义仓库：<strong>Settings → Plugins → ⚙ → Manage Plugin Repositories → 添加 URL</strong>。</p>\n<p>对于大型组织，推荐使用 <strong>JetBrains Marketplace for Organizations</strong>（原 Private Marketplace）服务，提供更完善的访问控制、审计日志和自动更新功能。</p>\n<p>企业内部分发的 CI/CD 流程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: Internal Plugin Release&#10;&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    tags:&#10;      - &#39;v*&#39;&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  release:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      - name: Build Plugin&#10;        run: ./gradlew buildPlugin&#10;&#10;      - name: Verify Plugin&#10;        run: ./gradlew verifyPlugin&#10;&#10;      - name: Upload to Internal Repository&#10;        run: |&#10;          VERSION=$(./gradlew properties -q | grep &quot;^version:&quot; | awk &#39;{print $2}&#39;)&#10;          ARTIFACT=&quot;build/distributions/internal-tool-${VERSION}.zip&quot;&#10;          curl -X PUT \\&#10;            -H &quot;Authorization: Bearer ${{ secrets.REPO_TOKEN }}&quot; \\&#10;            -F &quot;file=@${ARTIFACT}&quot; \\&#10; 