--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          VERSION=$(./gradlew properties -q | grep \"^version:\" | awk '{print $2}')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          ARTIFACT=\"build/distributions/internal-tool-${VERSION}.zip\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          curl -X PUT \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            -H \"Authorization: Bearer ${{ secrets.REPO_TOKEN }}\" \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            -F \"file=@${ARTIFACT}\" \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"https://plugins.company.com/api/upload\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Update Plugin Index</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          curl -X POST \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            -H \"Authorization: Bearer ${{ secrets.REPO_TOKEN }}\" \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"https://plugins.company.com/api/reindex\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((插件打包与分发))&#10;    打包构建&#10;      Gradle 构建&#10;      ZIP 分发格式&#10;      依赖管理&#10;    版本兼容&#10;      sinceBuild/untilBuild&#10;      构建号体系&#10;      Plugin Verifier&#10;    Marketplace 发布&#10;      API Token&#10;      审核流程&#10;      CI/CD 自动化&#10;    付费模式&#10;      Freemium&#10;      LicensingFacade&#10;      product-descriptor&#10;    企业分发&#10;      自定义仓库&#10;      XML 插件列表&#10;      访问控制\">mindmap\n  root((插件打包与分发))\n    打包构建\n      Gradle 构建\n      ZIP 分发格式\n      依赖管理\n    版本兼容\n      sinceBuild/untilBuild\n      构建号体系\n      Plugin Verifier\n    Marketplace 发布\n      API Token\n      审核流程\n      CI/CD 自动化\n    付费模式\n      Freemium\n      LicensingFacade\n      product-descriptor\n    企业分发\n      自定义仓库\n      XML 插件列表\n      访问控制</pre><ul>\n<li>IntelliJ 插件使用 Gradle 构建系统打包为 ZIP 格式，IntelliJ Platform Gradle Plugin 2.x 管理完整构建生命周期</li>\n<li>版本兼容性通过 <code>sinceBuild/untilBuild</code> 控制，Plugin Verifier 自动检测 API 兼容性问题</li>\n<li>JetBrains Marketplace 提供完善的发布流程，包含安全、兼容性和质量审核</li>\n<li>付费插件通过 <code>LicensingFacade</code> API 验证许可证，支持年度/月度订阅和永久许可证模式</li>\n<li>企业内部分发可使用自定义插件仓库，通过 HTTP 服务器提供 XML 格式的插件列表</li>\n<li>CI/CD 自动化是现代插件分发的最佳实践，确保每次发布都经过构建、验证和测试</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"插件打包与分发","id":"插件打包与分发"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"插件打包与版本管理","id":"插件打包与版本管理"},{"level":2,"text":"Plugin Verifier 与兼容性检查","id":"plugin-verifier-与兼容性检查"},{"level":2,"text":"Marketplace 发布流程","id":"marketplace-发布流程"},{"level":2,"text":"付费插件与许可证管理","id":"付费插件与许可证管理"},{"level":2,"text":"企业内部分发与自定义仓库","id":"企业内部分发与自定义仓库"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"检查与快速修复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/jetbrains-plugin/inspections-quickfix"},"next":null}